# The Network: Xbox
#
# Expects a gaming policy. Must precede Platforms/Microsoft.list, which would otherwise take the account hosts.
#
# Xbox, Game Pass and Minecraft. xbox.*.microsoft.com and xboxlive.com sit in the profile's always-real-ip, so a console's NAT probes reach the gateway by address and never match here.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gamepass.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,minecraft.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,minecraftservices.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mojang.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xbox.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xboxgamepass.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xboxlive.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xboxservices.com
